DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ppccaaggppiioo driver provides support for the Philips PCA955[4567] GPIO
     controllers.  The PCA955[467] devices have 8 pins and the PCA9555 device
     has 16 pins which can be configured as either inputs or outputs, and ac‐
     cessed using gpioctl(8).

